      "avalancheActivity": {
        "comment": "In steep rocky terrain and on very steep slopes small and medium sized avalanches are to be expected as the day progresses. Individual gliding avalanches can also occur. <br/> <br/> The wind slabs can be released even by a single winter sport participant in all aspects above the tree line. They will be covered with new snow and therefore difficult to recognise. Adjacent to ridgelines and in gullies and bowls and at the base of rock walls the likelihood of avalanches is higher.",
        "highlights": "Over a wide area 50 cm of snow, and even more in some localities, will fall."
