        "comment": "As a consequence of new snow and a moderate southerly wind, wind slabs will form adjacent to ridgelines and in gullies and bowls. <br/> Below approximately 2000 m only a little snow is lying. <br/> Towards its base, the snowpack is faceted and weak. <br/> The Avalanche Warning Service currently has only a small amount of information that has been collected in the field."
